      "rubric": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Lead the design of lessons, activities, and assessments aligned with <strong>NEP 2020, NCF, and SDG-linked priorities</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Curriculum design as per NEP 2020 and global standards and mapping to the same</p></li><li><p>Ensure strong alignment between learning objectives, pedagogy, activities, and assessments.</p></li><li><p>Apply experiential, learner-centric, and inquiry-driven approaches purposefully.</p></li><li><p>Develop and review learning materials, teacher guides, assessment and other resources.</p></li><li><p>Ensure age-appropriateness, conceptual accuracy, and cognitive load balance.</p></li><li><p>Identify and resolve instructional gaps or misalignments.</p></li><li><p>Work closely with academic, editorial, media, and delivery teams to ensure quality outcomes.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Skills sets:</strong></p><ol><li><p>Team management skills</p></li><li><p>Excellent written and oral communication</p></li><li><p>Readiness to explore latest EdTech and AI tools</p></li><li><p>Awareness about latest trends in K12 education</p></li><li><p>Research oriented</p></li></ol><p><strong>Qualifications:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Degree or postgraduate diploma in <strong>Instructional Design, Education, or related fields</strong>.</p></li><li><p>B.Sc/ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://M.Sc\">M.Sc</a>./ B.Tech/ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"http://M.Tech\">M.Tech</a> - STEM background preferred.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Experience:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Minimum 4-6years of experience</strong> in instructional design, learning design, or content development.</p></li><li><p><strong>Preferred:</strong> Experience with K–12 and/or STEM-related programmes.</p></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
